{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39499","headline":"宿山寺 · 张蠙","name":"宿山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中峰半夜起，忽觉有青冥。\n此界自生雨，上方犹有星。\n楼高钟尚远，殿古像多灵。\n好是潺湲水，房房伴诵经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《瀛奎律髓》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/瀛奎律髓_(四庫全書本)）"}